l          [PASS]\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\nPlease run this test using the forge command : \n```js\n forge test --match-path tests/PoCCore.t.sol --match-test submissionValidity -vvv\n```\n\nDetails output:\n```js\nRan 1 test for tests/PoCCore.t.sol:PoCCore\n[PASS] test_submissionValidity() (gas: 1264837)\nLogs:\n  MultiVault implementation address:  0xF62849F9A0B5Bf2913b396098F7c7019b51A820a\n  MultiVault proxy address:  0x5991A2dF15A8F6A256D3Ec51E99254Cd3fb576A9\n  AtomWallet implementation deployed at: 0xc7183455a4C133Ae270771860664b6B7ec320bB1\n  AtomWalletBeacon deployed at: 0xa0Cb889707d426A7A386870A03bc70d1b0697598\n  AtomWalletFactory implementation address:  0x1d1499e622D69689cdf9004d05Ec547d650Ff211\n  AtomWalletFactory proxy address:  0xA4AD4f68d0b91CFD19687c881e50f3A00242828c\n  WrappedTrust address:  0x03A6a84cD762D9707A21605b548aaaB891562aAb\n  TrustBonding implementation address:  0xD6BbDE9174b1CdAa358d2Cf4D57D1a9F7178FBfF\n  TrustBonding proxy address:  0x15cF58144EF33af1e14b5208015d11F9143E27b9\n  SatelliteEmissionsController Implementation 0x212224D2F2d262cd093eE13240ca4873fcCBbA3C\n  SatelliteEmissionsController Proxy 0x2a07706473244BC757E10F2a9E86fB532828afe3\n  BondingCurveRegistry address:  0xD16d567549A2a2a2005aEACf7fB193851603dd70\n  LinearCurve address:  0x3381cD18e2Fb4dB236BF0525938AB6E43Db0440f\n  OffsetProgressiveCurve address:  0x1aF7f588A501EA2B5bB3feeFA744892aA2CF00e6\n  ProgressiveCurve address:  0x756e0562323ADcDA4430d6cb456d9151f605290B\n  Added LinearCurve to registry with ID: 1\n  Added OffsetProgressiveCurve to registry with ID: 2\n  Added ProgressiveCurve to registry with ID: 3\n  === PoC: Last-Second Lock Sniping ===\n  epochLen              : 1209600\n  startTs               : 1\n  epochEnd(2)           : 3628801\n  [Epoch 0] Alice locked: 1000 WTRUST for 104 weeks\n  [Epoch 2, ts = 3628800 ] Bob locks (1 second before epoch end)\n  \n  --- E-1: Last-second lock in epoch-end snapshot ---\n  Bob lock duration in epoch 2 (s)      : 1